<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Najm Al-Madar | Oil &amp; Chemical Services</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Saira:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#06090f;
  --bg-2:#0b1320;
  --panel:#101b2e;
  --panel-2:#0d1726;
  --blue:#1565c0;
  --blue-bright:#2196f3;
  --blue-glow:#3ea0ff;
  --flame:#f4511e;
  --flame-bright:#ff7a18;
  --silver:#cdd7e2;
  --text:#eaf1f8;
  --muted:#8fa3b8;
  --line:rgba(62,160,255,.16);
  --line-warm:rgba(244,81,30,.22);
  --display:'Saira',sans-serif;
  --body:'Sora',sans-serif;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:var(--body);background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);overflow-x:hidden;line-height:1.8}
::selection{background:var(--flame);color:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.01em}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.wrap{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}
.grad-blue{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--blue-bright),var(--blue-glow));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.grad-flame{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--flame),var(--flame-bright));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}

/* NAV */
nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:1000;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 40px;transition:.4s;border-bottom:1px solid transparent}
nav.scrolled{background:rgba(6,9,15,.9);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 40px}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.logo img{width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;display:block;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line),0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.logo .name{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:1.28rem;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1}
.logo .name small{display:block;font-family:var(--body);font-weight:400;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:3.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:32px;align-items:center}
.nav-links a{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;position:relative;transition:.3s}
.nav-links a::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:-6px;width:0;height:2px;background:var(--flame);transition:.3s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--text)}.nav-links a:hover::after{width:100%}
.nav-cta{padding:10px 22px;border:1px solid var(--flame);border-radius:3px;color:var(--flame-bright)!important;font-weight:600}
.nav-cta:hover{background:var(--flame);color:#fff!important}.nav-cta::after{display:none}
.burger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer}
.burger span{width:26px;height:2px;background:var(--text);transition:.3s}

/* HERO */
header{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:120px 0 50px;
  background:radial-gradient(900px 620px at 80% 12%,rgba(33,150,243,.2),transparent 60%),radial-gradient(700px 500px at 12% 88%,rgba(244,81,30,.14),transparent 60%),linear-gradient(160deg,var(--bg),var(--bg-2) 75%)}
.grid-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(var(--line) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,var(--line) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:60px 60px;mask-image:radial-gradient(circle at 75% 35%,#000,transparent 72%);opacity:.45}
.hero-logo-wrap{position:absolute;right:-40px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:min(46vw,560px);aspect-ratio:1;pointer-events:none;z-index:1}
.hero-logo-wrap img{width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:50%;opacity:.9;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 60px rgba(33,150,243,.35))}
.hero-logo-wrap .halo{position:absolute;inset:-6%;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--line);animation:pulse 5s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:.5}50%{transform:scale(1.05);opacity:.15}}
.float{animation:float 6s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(-50%)}50%{transform:translateY(-54%)}}
.hero-content{position:relative;z-index:5;max-width:680px}
.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--flame-bright);text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:24px}
.eyebrow::before{content:"";width:34px;height:1px;background:var(--flame)}
.hero-content h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.8rem);margin-bottom:24px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.hero-content p{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:560px;margin-bottom:38px}
.btn-row{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{padding:15px 32px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:600;font-size:1rem;font-family:var(--body);cursor:pointer;border:none;transition:.35s;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--flame),var(--flame-bright));color:#fff}
.btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(244,81,30,.35)}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(143,163,184,.4);color:var(--text)}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--blue-bright);color:var(--blue-glow)}
.hero-stats{z-index:5;max-width:1200px;margin:60px auto 0;display:flex;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:26px}
.hero-stats .stat{flex:1;padding:0 24px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.hero-stats .stat:last-child{border-right:none}
.hero-stats .num{font-family:var(--display);font-size:2.4rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue-glow)}
.hero-stats .lbl{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)}

/* SECTION */
section{padding:120px 0;position:relative}
.sec-head{margin-bottom:64px;max-width:700px}
.sec-tag{font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:3.5px;color:var(--flame-bright);text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;display:block;margin-bottom:16px}
.sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.1rem);margin-bottom:18px}
.sec-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.06rem}

/* ABOUT */
#about{background:var(--bg-2)}
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:64px;align-items:center}
.about-text p{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:18px;font-size:1.04rem}
.vmv{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;margin-top:32px}
.vmv-card{background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--panel),var(--panel-2));border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--flame);padding:22px 24px;border-radius:5px;transition:.35s}
.vmv-card:hover{transform:translateX(8px);border-left-color:var(--flame-bright)}
.vmv-card h4{color:var(--blue-glow);font-size:1.12rem;margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.vmv-card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.96rem;margin:0}
.vmv-card svg{width:24px;height:24px;flex:none;stroke:var(--flame-bright)}
.about-visual{position:relative}
.about-visual .frame{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%,rgba(33,150,243,.12),var(--bg));aspect-ratio:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative}
.about-visual .frame img{width:84%;border-radius:50%;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(33,150,243,.3))}
.about-visual .badge{position:absolute;bottom:-22px;left:-22px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--flame),var(--flame-bright));color:#fff;padding:20px 26px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.about-visual .badge .b-num{font-family:var(--display);font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1}
.about-visual .badge .b-lbl{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:500}

/* SERVICES */
.svc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}
.svc-card{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--panel),var(--panel-2));border:1px solid var(--line);padding:36px 28px;border-radius:8px;transition:.4s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.svc-card::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--flame),transparent);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:.4s}
.svc-card:hover{transform:translateY(-8px);border-color:var(--line-warm);box-shadow:0 22px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
.svc-card:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}
.svc-ico{width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(33,150,243,.1);border:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:22px}
.svc-ico svg{width:28px;height:28px;stroke:var(--blue-glow)}
.svc-card h3{font-size:1.28rem;margin-bottom:12px}
.svc-card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.97rem}
.svc-num{position:absolute;top:24px;right:26px;font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.05rem;color:rgba(244,81,30,.4);font-weight:800}

/* PROJECTS */
#projects{background:var(--bg-2)}
.proj-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px}
.proj-card{position:relative;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;min-height:230px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),var(--bg));border:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:32px;transition:.4s}
.proj-card.tall{min-height:340px}
.proj-card::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(6,9,15,.94),rgba(6,9,15,.3));z-index:1}
.proj-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.22;z-index:0}.proj-bg svg{width:100%;height:100%}
.proj-info{position:relative;z-index:2}
.proj-cat{font-size:.76rem;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--flame-bright);text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600}
.proj-card h3{font-size:1.45rem;margin:8px 0 6px}
.proj-card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.94rem;margin:0}
.proj-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:var(--line-warm)}

/* TEAM & CERTS */
.team-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:54px;align-items:start}
.team-cards{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.team-card{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;padding:22px;background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--panel),var(--panel-2));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}
.team-avatar{width:70px;height:70px;flex:none;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue-bright),var(--blue));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.3rem;color:#fff;font-weight:800;border:2px solid var(--flame)}
.team-card h4{font-size:1.12rem}
.team-card .role{color:var(--blue-glow);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500}
.team-card .desc{color:var(--muted);font-size:.87rem;margin-top:3px}
.cert-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px}
.cert-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:18px 22px;background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--panel),var(--panel-2));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;transition:.3s}
.cert-item:hover{transform:translateX(8px);border-color:var(--line-warm)}
.cert-item .c-ico{width:44px;height:44px;flex:none;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(244,81,30,.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.cert-item .c-ico svg{width:24px;height:24px;stroke:var(--flame-bright)}
.cert-item h4{font-size:1.04rem}.cert-item span{font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted)}

/* CONTACT */
#contact{background:var(--bg-2)}
.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:54px}
.ci-item{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-bottom:28px;align-items:flex-start}
.ci-ico{width:48px;height:48px;flex:none;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(33,150,243,.1);border:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.ci-ico svg{width:24px;height:24px;stroke:var(--blue-glow)}
.ci-item h4{font-size:1.04rem;margin-bottom:3px}.ci-item p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}
.form-card{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:38px}
.field{margin-bottom:20px}.field label{display:block;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}
.field input,.field textarea{width:100%;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;color:var(--text);font-family:var(--body);font-size:.97rem;transition:.3s}
.field input:focus,.field textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--flame);background:var(--panel-2)}
.field textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:120px}
.form-note{font-size:.84rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px;text-align:center}

/* FOOTER */
footer{background:var(--bg);padding:64px 0 30px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.foot-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr 1fr;gap:44px;margin-bottom:46px}
.foot-brand .logo{margin-bottom:18px}
.foot-brand p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.94rem;max-width:330px}
.foot-col h4{font-size:1rem;color:var(--blue-glow);margin-bottom:18px}
.foot-col a{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.93rem;margin-bottom:11px;transition:.3s}
.foot-col a:hover{color:var(--flame-bright);padding-left:6px}
.foot-bottom{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:26px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px}
.foot-bottom p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.86rem}
.socials{display:flex;gap:12px}
.socials a{width:38px;height:38px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:.3s}
.socials a svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke:var(--muted);transition:.3s}
.socials a:hover{border-color:var(--flame)}.socials a:hover svg{stroke:var(--flame-bright)}

.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(34px);transition:.9s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}
.reveal.show{opacity:1;transform:none}

@media(max-width:980px){
  .about-grid,.team-layout,.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:44px}
  .svc-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .hero-stats{position:static;margin-top:50px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:26px 28px 0}
  .hero-stats .stat{min-width:45%;margin-bottom:20px;border-right:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:16px}
  .hero-logo-wrap{opacity:.28;right:-120px}
}
@media(max-width:680px){
  nav{padding:14px 22px}nav.scrolled{padding:10px 22px}
  .nav-links{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:78%;max-width:320px;background:var(--bg-2);flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:30px;transform:translateX(100%);transition:.4s;border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding:40px;z-index:999}
  .nav-links.open{transform:translateX(0)}
  .burger{display:flex;z-index:1001}
  .svc-grid,.proj-grid,.foot-top{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .wrap{padding:0 20px}section{padding:80px 0}
  .about-visual .badge{left:auto;right:16px}
  .logo .name{font-size:1.1rem}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav id="nav">
  <a href="#home" class="logo">
    <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Najm Al-Madar logo">
    <span class="name">NAJM AL-MADAR<small>OIL &amp; CHEMICAL SERVICES</small></span>
  </a>
  <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
    <a href="#team">Team</a>
    <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
  <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
</nav>

<header id="home">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-logo-wrap float">
    <div class="halo"></div>
    <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Najm Al-Madar emblem">
  </div>
  <div class="wrap hero-content">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal">Integrated Engineering Solutions</span>
    <h1 class="reveal">Your Trusted Partner in <span class="grad-blue">Oil &amp; Gas</span> and <span class="grad-flame">Water Treatment</span></h1>
    <p class="reveal">Najm Al-Madar delivers precise oil &amp; water analysis, treatment-chemical evaluation, corrosion control, and laboratory supervision to the leading oilfields across Iraq — built on technical excellence and uncompromising quality standards.</p>
    <div class="btn-row reveal">
      <a href="#services" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Services
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Request a Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap"><div class="hero-stats reveal">
    <div class="stat"><div class="num">15+</div><div class="lbl">Years of Experience</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="num">4+</div><div class="lbl">Major Oilfields</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="num">50+</div><div class="lbl">Projects Delivered</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="num">100%</div><div class="lbl">Quality Commitment</div></div>
  </div></div>
</header>

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-text reveal">
      <span class="sec-tag">About Us</span>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.9rem);margin-bottom:22px">Engineering Expertise That Delivers Reliable Results</h2>
      <p>Najm Al-Madar is a specialized firm providing engineering and laboratory solutions for the oil, gas, and water treatment sector. We combine high technical competence with strict adherence to safety and quality standards to serve major oilfields.</p>
      <p>Our work is led by a team of chemical engineers and laboratory supervisors with extensive field experience in oil and water analysis, corrosion control, and treatment-chemical evaluation.</p>
      <div class="vmv">
        <div class="vmv-card"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 1v6m0 6v6m11-7h-6m-6 0H1"/></svg>Our Vision</h4><p>To be the foremost and most trusted partner in laboratory and engineering solutions for the region's energy sector.</p></div>
        <div class="vmv-card"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="M22 4 12 14.01l-3-3"/></svg>Our Mission</h4><p>To provide precise analysis and treatment services that protect our clients' assets and enhance production efficiency.</p></div>
        <div class="vmv-card"><h4><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>Our Values</h4><p>Precision, integrity, safety, and continuous improvement are the pillars of every project we undertake.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-visual reveal">
      <div class="frame"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Najm Al-Madar"></div>
      <div class="badge"><div class="b-num">ISO</div><div class="b-lbl">Certified Quality Standards</div></div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<section id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal"><span class="sec-tag">Our Services</span><h2>Comprehensive Solutions Across Every Phase</h2><p>A full suite of technical services tailored to the specific demands of the oil, gas, and water treatment industry.</p></div>
    <div class="svc-grid">
      <div class="svc-card reveal"><span class="svc-num">01</span><div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M9 3v6l-5 9a2 2 0 0 0 2 3h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-3l-5-9V3"/><path d="M7 3h10M9 13h6"/></svg></div><h3>Oil &amp; Water Analysis</h3><p>Precise characterization of crude oil and produced water, with full well-sample profiling to ensure production quality.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-card reveal"><span class="svc-num">02</span><div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M10 2v7.31M14 9.3V2M8.5 2h7M14 9.3a6.5 6.5 0 1 1-4 0"/></svg></div><h3>Treatment Chemical Evaluation</h3><p>Testing and evaluating the effectiveness of treatment chemicals and selecting the optimal solutions for your operations.</p></div>
      <div class="svc-card reveal"><span class="svc-num">03</span><div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div><h3>Corrosion Control</h3><p>Integrated monitoring and corrosion-mitigation programs for pipelines and equipment to extend operational life.</p></div>
